// 交给析构义务检验器的情形：只在一条分支上移走、整体赋值、按值参数、循环里的局部值、借用跨过分支
class Arr(len: Int)
class File(fd: Int) deinit
fun consume(own f: File): Unit trusted
fun consumeArr(own a: Arr): Unit trusted
fun movedOnOneBranch(): Unit {
  val f = File(1)
  val g = File(2)
  if (*) {
    consume(move f)
  }
  use(g.fd)
}
fun plainMovedOnOneBranch(): Unit {
  val a = Arr(1)
  if (*) {
    consumeArr(move a)
  }
  val b = Arr(2)
  use(b.len)
}
fun reassigned(): Unit {
  val f = File(1)
  f = File(2)
  use(f.fd)
}
fun ownParams(own f: File, own a: Arr): Unit {
  use(a.len)
  val b = Arr(2)
  use(b.len)
}
fun loopLocal(): Unit {
  val f = File(1)
  while (*) {
    val a = Arr(1)
    consumeArr(move a)
    val g = File(2)
  }
  use(f.fd)
}
fun loanAcrossBranch(): Unit {
  val a = Arr(1)
  val r = &a.len
  if (*) {
    use(r)
  }
  val b = Arr(2)
  use(b.len)
}
fun movedThenUsed(): Unit {
  val f = File(1)
  if (*) {
    consume(move f)
  }
  use(f.fd)  // ERR K8
}
